{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42915","headline":"石楠树 · 胡玢","name":"石楠树","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"本自清江石上生，移栽此处称闲情。\n青云士尽识珍木，白屋人多唤俗名。\n重布绿阴滋藓色，深藏好鸟引雏声。\n余今一日千回看，每度看来眼益明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡玢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42915.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42915","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}